message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The concept DOI always resolves to the latest release.
type: dataset
title: "Internacia Datasets: reference data of countries, intergovernmental organizations, and country groups"
authors:
  - name: "Dateno (Common Data Index)"
    website: "https://dateno.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/datenoio/internacia-db"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20706176
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20706176
    description: "Zenodo concept DOI (resolves to the latest version)"
license: CC-BY-4.0
