version: 3.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-26
keywords:
  - countries
  - ISO 3166
  - intergovernmental organizations
  - reference data
  - entity linking
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Structured reference data for 256 countries and territories, 1275
  intergovernmental organizations and country groups (intblocks), and 78
  organization block types. Designed for entity linking, geographic
  classification, and membership joins. Internacia is part of the Dateno
  open-source project. Data and documentation are licensed CC-BY-4.0; the
  build and validation code is licensed MIT (see LICENSE and DATA_LICENSE).
  The centroid field is derived from mledoze/countries (ODbL-1.0); see
  ATTRIBUTION.md for third-party source obligations.
